{{define "content"}}<section class="grammar">
  <h1>文法</h1>
  {{/* Whole-branch review C-1. A conversation turn's corrections are
       stored as jsonb on conversation_turns, not as rows in
       correction_concepts, and this page counts correction_concepts —
       so a concept the tutor corrected out loud eleven times reads
       「未遭遇 / 遭遇回数 0」here. That is a FALSE answer to the page's
       own question, not merely a missing one, and this is the same
       exclusion /outcomes already discloses (outcomes.html.tmpl) —
       the wording is deliberately kept close to it so a learner reading
       both pages meets one consistent statement. */}}
  <p class="description">
    ここの<strong>遭遇回数</strong>は、<strong>添削に出した文章</strong>だけを数えています。会話練習と音声練習で指摘された文法は
    別の場所に記録されるため、ここには含まれません。「未遭遇」は「一度も出てきていない」ではなく
    「添削では記録がない」という意味です。
  </p>

  {{/* One line per concept, expanding. The catalog is the whole of
       JLPT N5–N1 — four hundred-odd concepts — and as a four-column
       table that was four hundred stacked cards, sixteen hundred lines
       of thumb-scrolling at 390px.

       The line answers "which concept, how hard, have I met it". The
       explanation and an example sit one disclosure deep: ConceptStats
       already carries them (they are columns of the same table it
       scans), so reading what a concept IS no longer costs a page load
       per concept. */}}
  <ul class="list list--card">
    {{range .Concepts}}
    {{/* data-slug is the row's stable identity — the name is a link and
         wraps, so anything reading it out of the markup is parsing
         presentation. */}}
    <li class="list__item" data-slug="{{.Slug}}">
      <details>
        <summary class="list__line">
          <span class="list__primary">{{.Name}}</span>
          <span class="badge badge--jlpt badge--jlpt-{{.JLPTChip | lower}}">{{.JLPTChip}}</span>
          {{/* Encounters, not the date: "have I met this" is the
               question, and 0 vs 16 answers it at a glance where
               2026-08-17 does not. The date is in the detail. */}}
          <span class="list__meta" title="遭遇回数">{{if .Encounters}}{{.Encounters}}回{{else}}未遭遇{{end}}</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="list__detail">
          {{if .Description}}<p class="list__gloss">{{.Description}}</p>{{end}}
          {{if .Example}}<p lang="ja">{{.Example}}{{template "speak" .Example}}</p>{{end}}
          <p>{{if .Encounters}}最終確認 {{.LastSeen.Format "2006-01-02"}}{{else}}添削での記録はありません{{end}}</p>
          <p><a href="/grammar/{{.Slug}}">詳しく見る →</a></p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </li>
    {{else}}
    <li class="list__item list__empty"><p class="empty">文法コンセプトがありません</p></li>
    {{end}}
  </ul>
</section>{{end}}
